   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_BERN_01">Hotel Schweizerhof</name>
                            </addrLine>           <addrLine>Berne</addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>
                        <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">MS</seg> safely received here. Will read and report in a day or two</p>
                    <closer>                                            	<salute>Greetings</salute>                                                        	<signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">J.J.</name>
                        </signed>
                        <dateline>
                            <date when="1939-08-17">17.8.39</date>
                        </dateline>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">Budgen’s manuscript, an overview of <name type="work" key="W_FINNEGANSWAKE">Finnegans Wake</name>, was intended for the <name type="work">Fortnightly Review</name> but was eventually published as “Joyce’s Chapters of Going Forth by Day”, <name type="work">Horizon</name> (4, no. 21 [September 1941]: 172-91).</note>
            </div>
      </body>
